Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,曾經有一個男人得到了世間的一切，傳說中的海賊王哥爾·D·羅傑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,他臨刑前的遺言驅使著人們奔向大海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,我的財富和寶藏嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.18,Main,,0,0,0,,想要的話就給你們吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,去找吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.87,Main,,0,0,0,,我把一切都放在那個地方了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,人們為了追尋夢想而出海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,世界迎來了大海賊時代！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:29.32,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:33.82,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.49,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:43.07,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise our flag to the Break of Romance Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:43.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366,460)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs40}Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:49.73,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let the waves crash, they'll jump start us out of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.84,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,438)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Time-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:54.26,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,If we're going to go to an incredible world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:54.26,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(277,493)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:58.79,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,you'll have to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:58.79,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(510,470)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.73,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Standing out too much, is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:04.62,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wanted → Means a Winner ( • v • )
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:10.50,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:15.99,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Forget our worries, just let the wind blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.52,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be the first to find One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.52,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1047,408)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:22.48,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our hearts dream beyond measure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:26.93,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,so let's never wake them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:29.41,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:33.54,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:37.33,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:44.72,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We... made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.62,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go... wherever our dreams take us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:52.70,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,and we won't leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:55.30,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go at it with all our hearts, that's a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:59.30,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,On that day when our dreams began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:03.72,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,we set our goals and they've never changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.24,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:10.61,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,The sun in my heart will never set!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:13.38,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:17.55,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.75,0:02:24.82,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:30.03,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:39.04,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}魚人島之王\N受邀前往龍宮城！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:42.46,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,安靜⋯⋯安靜點！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:45.68,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,趁現在！快上船！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:48.25,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,每個人都拿起船槳，準備出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:55.67,Captions,Sign,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(520,0)}魚人街\N「諾亞」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:58.93,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快！快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.69,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們隨時都有可能追過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:03.36,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,我們不能再待在魚人島了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.91,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,快點越過紅土大陸！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:08.18,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惡！我真的好想去看人魚咖啡廳！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:12.37,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,死心吧，白癡！別說話了，快划！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:15.20,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,真是的⋯⋯太不可思議了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:20.10,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,海怪正好在海底睡覺，\N所以我們才僥倖避開了⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:22.55,Main,Gyro,0,0,4,,然後下潛了一萬公尺。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:27.12,Captions,Sign,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(520,0)}南海海賊\N蟹手吉洛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:27.12,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(256,100)\fad(520,0)}懸賞金：7300萬貝里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.40,Main,Gyro,0,0,4,,然後那些海怪把我們團團圍住⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.12,Main,Gyro,0,0,4,,我們連反抗都做不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:31.62,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,加入魚人還是去死？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:35.44,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,當時我們根本\N別無選擇只能加入他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.56,0:03:38.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們離人魚咖啡廳越來越遠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.81,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,別哭了！繼續划，弟兄們！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:45.52,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,能保住性命就算幸運了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:49.26,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,咦？他們逃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:51.24,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,是的，老大。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:55.58,Main,Dosun,0,0,200,,{\an8}又逃了嗎-哆遜？\N他們永遠學不乖-哆遜。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:55.58,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}新魚人海賊團成員\N哆遜 {\fs28}（雙髻鯊魚人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:59.45,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}新魚人海賊團成員\N乘奧 {\fs28}（鬚鯊魚人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.45,Main,Zeo,0,0,100,,{\an8}人類老是逃跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:03.42,Main,Daruma,0,0,100,,{\an8}也許我應該去把他們撕碎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.42,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}新魚人海賊團成員\N達摩 {\fs28}（達摩鯊魚人）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.56,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,沒關係。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:12.40,Main,Hody,0,0,4,,我們可以利用他們殺雞儆猴。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:13.43,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}新魚人海賊團船長\N乘地·乘斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:13.43,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(270,100)\fad(500,0)}大白鯊魚人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:17.95,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,500)}新魚人海賊團成員\N伊卡洛斯·乘奇 {\fs28}（大王烏賊魚人）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:17.85,Main,Ikaros,0,0,100,,{\an8}那麼，要我去追他們嗎-嗨？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:20.23,Main,Hody,0,0,100,,{\an8}不用了，伊卡洛斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.27,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,呣嗨，了解。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:23.57,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我自己去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:24.23,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.60,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,準備一個泡泡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:39.36,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,你不能一次吃那麼多興奮劑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.77,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,好了，到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.92,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,這是我的家！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.69,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:10.31,Main,Peoplez,0,0,0,,{\i1}歡迎回來，主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:12.50,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,哎呀！是帕帕古先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.39,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,太厲害了！真的是他嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.72,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,是吧，你們嚇到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:24.98,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,在海上我只不過是一隻時尚的海星。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:28.61,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,但在魚人島，\N我可是Criminal服裝品牌的社長。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:32.80,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,超級人氣的名人設計師！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.83,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,我的品牌聞名全世界，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.95,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,每個國家的店鋪都有賣！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.42,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,就連那個有名的Doskoi Panda{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:44.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,噢，看那邊！那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:46.33,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,Criminal的專賣店就在一樓。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:49.61,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的嗎？我們去看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:48.45,Secondary,Pappagg,0,0,0,,卡蜜⋯⋯卡蜜⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:50.37,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.66,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:55.66,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,你們聽不聽⋯⋯我說話⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:00.42,Secondary,Store-Man,0,0,100,,{\an8}等等，親愛的顧客，您太過分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.66,Secondary,Store-Man,0,0,100,,{\an8}我們賣的可是非常高級的品牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:01.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.93,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,聽起來店員有麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.05,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,有人在投訴嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:09.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我說啊，你們的價格太高了！雖然衣服是挺可愛的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個聲音⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.55,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好吧，降到一萬貝里。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:18.00,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,那不行的，親愛的顧客！\N那連原價的一半都不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:21.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,果然是她。那個殺價狂。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:24.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.63,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,娜美阿琴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:27.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,卡蜜！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.95,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,噢，帕帕古先生，來得正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.56,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,我們這裡有位比較難纏的顧客⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.27,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.52,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等等，這是你的店？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:40.04,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,為什麼價格這麼高？你想敲我竹槓嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.55,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:45.80,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,嗯，品牌本來就貴。\N畢竟我是人氣設計師⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:46.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,給我打折！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.09,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,不，等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.72,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,別這麼凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:55.36,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,兩年前你們幫了我大忙，我很感謝你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:58.68,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,免費送你們！喜歡什麼隨便拿！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.92,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,免費？真的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:04.90,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,先生！他們把整間店都搬空了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.04,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}你們還真是不客氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.49,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,你真幸運。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.42,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,嗯？那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.41,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,外面好吵鬧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.10,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,先生！大消息！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.72,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.05,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,他⋯他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.12,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,他為什麼會來這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:25.59,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,那是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:29.09,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,往天上看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:31.76,Main,Store-Man,0,0,0,,他從王宮下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:37.74,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,佳蒙！佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那是什麼？鯨魚？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:41.40,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,他為什麼會來這種低下的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.68,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,我第一次親眼看到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:48.31,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？他連護衛都沒帶！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:53.18,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,太不可思議了！他竟然突然自己跑下來了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.72,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,難道發生了什麼國家危機？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:07.17,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}龍宮王國統治者\N海神·乘頓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:07.17,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(210,100)\fad(500,0)}腔棘魚人魚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:07.17,Main,Neptune,0,0,4,,乘頓。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.20,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}小寶\N（他的愛鯨）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那隻人魚好大隻！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:15.37,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我比較喜歡那些美人魚。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.65,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}嘿，你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:19.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好蓬頭的老頭啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.64,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}我跟你說，你太無禮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:23.59,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}快跪下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:25.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那隻鯨魚好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.25,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,他是來找那些人類的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:32.16,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,喂，梅加洛。確定是這些人嗎-佳蒙？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:37.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,咦？我們來的路上是不是見過那條鯊魚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.50,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,嘿，戴草帽的人類，還有你的朋友們。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.70,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,我是來⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:45.74,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,帶你們⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.96,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,去龍宮城的-佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.70,Main,Caimie and Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:56.61,Main,Caimie and Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}龍⋯龍⋯龍⋯龍⋯龍宮城？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,龍宮城？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:04.72,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,0)}魚人街「諾亞」附近\N深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:03.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,100,,{\an8}快！划快一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.72,Main,Gyro,0,0,100,,{\an8}不然會被發現的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:08.09,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們被深海流捲住了！好難划！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.20,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,所以我才說應該\N在船上裝個螺旋槳的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:14.20,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,你知道新世界有多殘酷嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:16.81,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,船長，快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.21,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,前面有東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:23.84,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,乘地·乘斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.30,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不⋯不可能！他找到我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:29.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,咦？他⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:36.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那是什麼？他戴著手銬！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.48,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.23,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那個混蛋跑哪去了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.50,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他穿破了船殼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.04,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,把他幹掉！敵人只有一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.50,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,我以前跟魚人交手過。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:05.27,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,你以為我經歷了多少考驗才走到這裡的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:10.94,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,你只不過是一條魚！\N別小看人類，蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:11.53,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:16.62,Main,Gyro,0,0,0,,{\i1}可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:33.36,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,嘖，我們拿到的是個麻煩東西呢-嗨。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:37.27,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,興奮劑⋯⋯能量類固醇。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:41.95,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,魚人天生的體力是普通人類的十倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:48.42,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,然而，只要吃一顆能量類固醇，你的力量就會再翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.55,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,相當於人類的二十倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:53.34,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,吃兩顆又會再倍增！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:57.30,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,這夢幻般的力量的代價是會縮短壽命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:02.22,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,但是，我們願意以早死來換取實現我們的目標！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那⋯那個混蛋在幹嘛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:09.10,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他拿著桅杆要幹嘛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:13.20,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我現在明白他為什麼戴著手銬了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:17.09,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他是在向我們展示，\N他連手都不用就能擊沉我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:24.00,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,費雪·泰格的命是被人類奪走的！\N惡龍的意志也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:27.99,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,我們這一代要終結\N魚人島黑暗的被壓迫歷史！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:31.33,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,由我們新魚人海賊團來終結它！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:48.51,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,漂到新世界去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:56.83,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,噢，天哪⋯⋯你沒有把他們都殺了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.17,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,沒有，我需要他們活著。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:06.90,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,帶著那些傷活下去，\N讓海面上的世界看到⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:11.77,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你們在海底遭遇了什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:14.56,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,告訴他們你們遇到了誰！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:19.06,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,告訴陸地上的人類我們有多可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:22.46,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我們將從那個可悲的海神王手中\N奪取世界中心魚人島，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:26.02,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,然後把你們人類\N拖入深海的黑暗深淵！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:31.36,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我們會讓所有人知道魚人才是優等種族！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:36.83,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我們要教訓你們，魚人才是優等種族！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.39,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,數小時前⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.39,0:12:42.87,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,龍宮王國，人魚海灣。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.94,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,這東西封得好緊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:50.10,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,不知道裡面裝了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.56,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,如果是寶藏的話，應該會裝在箱子裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.89,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,既然只是個桶，\N也許裝的是什麼高級美酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.88,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,好⋯⋯好難⋯⋯打開！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:04.11,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,噢，夠了夠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:12.69,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,打開到這個程度就綽綽有餘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.74,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,什麼？！裡面竟然有人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:16.32,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:27.35,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,太感謝你們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:32.87,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,真的很感激，親愛的人魚們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:36.39,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,別想逃哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:38.59,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,快！跳進水裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:45.01,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,已經太遲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.54,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,我⋯⋯在下沉⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.65,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,是沼澤！\N這種岩石地帶怎麼會有沼澤？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:58.39,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,你們擺脫不了這片泥沼的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:01.07,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,是無底的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:06.32,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,我是惡魔果實能力者。\N吃了沼沼果實的沼澤人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:09.19,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,你越掙扎⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:10.86,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:13.94,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,⋯⋯沉得越快！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.10,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:20.34,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,拜託別叫。我不會殺你們的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:22.15,Main,Ishilly,0,0,0,,有人{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:27.55,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,{\i1}我不是剛說了不要叫嗎，笨蛋？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:28.70,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,伊希莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:32.93,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,我只需要你們睡一小會兒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:54.71,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,我的身體是無底的⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.46,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,一條人魚能賣多少錢來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:02.80,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,我記得拍賣的底價好像是七千萬一條。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.14,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,那三條的話⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.65,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,多虧了草帽海賊團！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:15.70,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,多虧他們，我才能不用登記就進入魚人島⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.70,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,還能自由地捕捉高級人魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.75,Main,Caribou,0,0,0,,這裡簡直是座寶島！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:27.57,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(400,0)}龍宮王國港口城鎮\N「珊瑚丘」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:27.57,Main,Knight,0,0,100,,{\an8}草帽海賊團？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:31.53,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,把人魚海灣的女孩們綁架走的就是他們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:34.57,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,不，我沒這麼說。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.65,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,他們看起來是好人⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:39.57,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,而且他們是卡蜜的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.27,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,她可能是被威脅的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.10,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:45.94,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,如果看事實的話，\N當時在場的只有⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:48.47,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,我們守衛、那些女孩們、
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:51.13,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,被打敗的魚人街那群人⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:54.47,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,以及草帽海賊團。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:58.57,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,而且他們消失之後做了什麼，沒有人能作證。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:02.60,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,人類總是有綁架人魚的理由。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:06.93,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,在人類社會中，年輕的人魚能賣到高價。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:10.39,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,即便如此，你也不能光憑猜測就指控他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:17.38,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,你知道過去有多少人類裝出友善的樣子，然後綁架了人魚嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:20.96,Main,Knight,0,0,0,,福卡博西王子。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:24.86,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,還有夏莉夫人，\N關於您剛才說的⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:28.27,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,您真的看到了那樣的未來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:35.94,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,海賊草帽魯夫\N將會毀滅魚人島？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.88,Main,Mermaid,0,0,0,,夏莉夫人，喝點水吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:47.63,Main,Shyarly,0,0,0,,是的，我看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.19,Main,Shyarly,0,0,0,,那就是我所看到的，毫無疑問。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:56.26,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,連我們龍宮城都聽聞過您預言的準確度。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.10,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,這真是進退兩難。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:05.24,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們本來打算感謝他們救了公主的寵物。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:10.71,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,但現在，即使這個預言未經證實，我們也不能放任他們自由行動。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:13.43,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,我們必須抓住他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:16.57,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}龍宮王國\N高級住宅區：「魚鰭利山丘」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.57,Main,Fishman,0,0,100,,{\an8}他們走了⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:19.50,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,他們到底是什麼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:24.06,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,乘頓國王竟然親自邀請他們去龍宮城。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.79,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,不要掉下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:31.97,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,乘頓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這老頭子怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.91,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個喊叫也太誇張了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:43.68,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}別那麼無禮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.99,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}草帽，你好可怕！你真的嚇到我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:51.04,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,那條鯊魚，梅加洛⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.96,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,牠是我女兒的寵物，\N她非常珍愛牠-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:18:01.19,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,梅加洛沒有回來的時候，她一直哭個不停。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:03.70,Main,Neptune,0,0,100,,{\an8}原來牠被海怪攻擊了⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:06.66,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,500)}梅加洛 {\fs28}（人魚公主的愛鯊）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:07.71,Main,Neptune,0,0,200,,{\an8}那真的很危險，\N我很感謝你們救了牠-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:13.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯，只是碰巧而已，\N但能救到牠確實是件好事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.05,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,所以牠是人魚公主的寵物？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:21.91,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,噢？帕帕古先生，你之前\N不是說過你跟人魚公主是好朋友嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,噢，原來那是騙人的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:29.55,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,真⋯真的可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:34.75,Main,Caimie,0,0,0,,讓我們一起去龍宮城。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:38.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他都說了「歡迎你們的朋友一起來-佳蒙」，有什麼問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:45.99,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,說實話，我派了兒子們去接你們，\N但他們到現在還沒回來-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:47.84,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,所以我決定親自去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:53.50,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,畢竟，我自己也很期待宴會，想早點開始吃-佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:58.67,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,啊，我忘了說，你們有一位同伴\N已經被帶過去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.48,Main,Nami & Usopp,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:04.40,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,是一個劍士。他已經開始喝酒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:09.45,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,宴會人齊了才更好玩。\N真是個任性的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.46,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,我記得他的名字是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.03,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,索隆嗎。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:14.43,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,果然是索隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:15.70,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,索利！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.27,Main,Nami & Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}是索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:28.91,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,衛兵們正在找你們其他的同伴，會邀請他們所有人到城裡來，所以不用擔心-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:32.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,娜美，你知道他們去哪了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:38.09,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,有這麼多人在，也許能比預期更快找到情報。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:39.12,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:42.53,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,我最想知道的是，去哪裡能找到\N我船匠師傅的家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:45.62,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,這裡是湯姆先生的故鄉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:49.57,Flashbacks,Robin,0,0,0,,我也有一些想調查的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.57,0:19:50.93,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,你也是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:55.67,Flashbacks,Robin,0,0,0,,自古以來，魚人島就是一座民間傳說豐富的島嶼。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:59.07,Flashbacks,Robin,0,0,0,,我確信這裡也有⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.50,Flashbacks,Robin,0,0,0,,珍貴的歷史碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:04.85,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,結果我們又走散了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你們沒遇到什麼麻煩吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:10.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,嗯，你可以說有，\N也可以說沒有⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,話說老頭子。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:17.06,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,那是海神·乘頓大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:24.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在海面下一萬公尺，為什麼\N魚人島周圍這麼明亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:29.18,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,不是魚人島周圍明亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:36.74,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,這裡是海底唯一能照到陽光的地方，所以很久以前魚人就開始在這裡定居了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:39.75,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,魚人島就是這樣建立的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:44.61,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,寶樹夏娃的根部\N延伸到了這個深度。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:49.09,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,它把陽光從海面\N直接傳導到海底。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:50.47,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,傳導陽光？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:55.18,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你是說這棵樹有發光的根部，\N延伸到海面下一萬公尺？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:21:00.14,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,沒錯。科學家們不斷提出新理論來解釋這個現象，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.14,0:21:04.98,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,但它就是一棵在海面接收光線、從根部散發光線的神秘大樹-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:10.38,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,而且它的呼吸作用還會為海底供給空氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:15.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,所以就像夏波帝的\N活力滿滿紅樹林的大老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，蓬頭老頭，我餓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:18.52,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.96,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,快到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:25.40,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,那裡就是入口-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:29.60,Main,Talking Doorbell,0,0,0,,{\i1}叮咚。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:30.56,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.84,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,是我-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:33.92,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,那句話⋯⋯陛⋯陛下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:35.92,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,我立刻放下通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:40.47,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,泡泡戴好-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:43.16,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,來吧，我們走。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:48.15,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,乘頓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好期待去龍宮城啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.99,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,到了-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:05.37,Captions,Sign,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,0)}龍宮王國王宮\N龍宮城
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.05,0:22:20.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好厲害！太酷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:23.90,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,帕帕古先生的豪宅跟這比簡直像跳蚤一樣小。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:24.81,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,{\i1}別拿來比較！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.32,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好漂亮的城堡！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.65,0:22:32.03,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,乘頓國王回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:34.28,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,我正在想他去哪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.74,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,開門！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:37.57,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,開門！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.83,Main,Voice,0,0,0,,{\i1}歡迎回來，陛下！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:50.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這座城堡看起來好好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:54.85,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,這是我的王宮-佳蒙！把這裡當自己的家吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:55.87,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}真是受不了！你又來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:23:01.95,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}你又不考慮自己的身分就獨自跑出王國了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:06.57,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}連護衛都不帶就跑到下面去，像話嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:07.87,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.63,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,以後會注意的-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:13.07,Thoughts,The Shocked Crowd,0,0,0,,{\i1}他被罵了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:16.00,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,萬一出了什麼事，道歉也來不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:21.30,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道我們國家現在的處境？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.48,0:23:25.96,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,別管那些了，看！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:31.69,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,我把在梅加洛被海怪欺負時\N救了牠的人帶來了-佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:35.29,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,來，歡迎我們的客人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:38.46,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,呃，白星公主在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:41.86,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,呃，陛下，好像又發生了⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:46.98,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,什麼？！都是因為你們沒有\N好好看著公主讓她冷靜下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:48.44,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,你們這群蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:50.07,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}而你就這樣⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:56.66,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}不聲不響地消失了！你不覺得大家都在擔心你嗎，陛下？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:57.88,Main,Merman,0,0,0,,{\i1}首先⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:24:01.25,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,我保證以後會注意的-佳蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:03.49,Thoughts,The Shocked Crowd,0,0,0,,{\i1}又被罵了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:07.44,Main,Right Minister,0,0,100,,{\an8}非常抱歉在您剛帶客人來的時候提這件事⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:11.76,Main,Right Minister,0,0,100,,{\an8}但有要事需要商議。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.20,0:24:12.21,Captions,Character Box,480,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,500)}龍宮王國 右大臣\N（海馬人魚）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:14.97,Main,Left Minister,0,0,100,,{\an8}是的，福卡博西王子⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:16.89,Main,Left Minister,0,0,100,,{\an8}剛才聯絡了我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.23,0:24:18.02,Captions,,0,450,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(500,500)}龍宮王國 左大臣\N（鯰魚人魚）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:18.70,Main,Left Minister,0,0,100,,{\an8}我們該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:22.04,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,你說福卡博西？發生了什麼事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:23.61,Main,Left Minister,0,0,0,,事情是這樣的⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.77,0:24:27.79,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他們打算無視我們到什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:29.59,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,咦？魯夫去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.45,0:24:33.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他剛才明明還在的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:36.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他連一分鐘都靜不下來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:40.12,Main,Pappagg,0,0,0,,他在想什麼啊，竟然在神聖的土地上亂跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:42.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯，就是這邊⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:45.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好吃的食物的味道！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:02.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,也許宴會就在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.65,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們不是說索隆已經在了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.61,0:25:10.65,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不過這扇門還真是又大又厚又堅固！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.65,0:25:16.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,牆壁看起來也很堅固。\N簡直跟推進城的牆壁一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:18.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,裡面到底有什麼好吃的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:27.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,裡面一片漆黑⋯⋯\N所以這裡不是宴會廳？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:32.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,但這裡確實有很香的食物味道！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:35.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以這是食物倉庫嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.07,0:25:37.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,算了，不管了！我先吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:39.29,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我的飢餓已經到極限了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:42.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.66,0:25:46.89,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,在這座島上走到哪裡都有珊瑚啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:52.80,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是什麼？好軟⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:58.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？剛才有人在說話嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:03.69,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這個珊瑚摸起來像布丁！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:06.14,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,有人在嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.10,0:26:15.12,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:22.59,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,你在別人的身上做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:28.14,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,100,,{\an8}你是什麼人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:30.75,Captions,Character Box,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(730,0)}龍宮王國公主\N白星公主 {\fs28}（巨型銀魚人魚）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.75,0:26:35.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！是一個巨大的人⋯⋯不，是人魚？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:39.58,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,你⋯你也是來取我性命的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.58,0:26:42.15,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,但⋯但我不怕你！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.15,0:26:45.34,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,畢竟我是乘頓的女兒⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.34,0:26:46.96,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,所以我才不⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.96,0:26:49.69,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,我才不⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:53.27,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,來人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.27,0:26:56.96,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,父王！哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.96,0:27:00.35,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂喂⋯⋯我什麼都沒做啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:06.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你到底怎麼回事啊？！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

